{
  "snp3.9:0.1": "",
  "snp3.9:0.2": "",
  "snp3.9:1.1": "Evam me sutaṃ: ",
  "snp3.9:1.2": "Ekaṃ samayaṃ Bhagavā Icchānaṃkale viharati Icchānaṃkalavanasaṇḍe. ",
  "snp3.9:1.3": "Tena kho pana samayena sambahulā abhiññātā abhiññātā brāhmaṇamahāsālā Icchānaṃkale paṭivasanti, seyyathīdaṃ: ",
  "snp3.9:1.4": "Caṃkī brāhmaṇo Tārukkho brāhmaṇo Pokkharasāti brāhmaṇo Jāṇussoṇi brāhmaṇo Todeyyabrāhmaṇo aññe ca abhiññātā abhiññātā brāhmaṇamahāsālā. ",
  "snp3.9:1.5": "Atha kho Vāseṭṭha-Bhāradvājānaṃ māṇavānaṃ jaṃghāvihāraṃ anucaṃkamamānānaṃ anuvicaramānānaṃ ayam antarākathā udapādi: ",
  "snp3.9:1.6": "\"kathaṃ bho brāhmaṇo hotī\" ti. ",
  "snp3.9:2.1": "Bhāradvājo māṇavo evam āha: ",
  "snp3.9:2.2": "\"yato kho bho ubhato sujāto hoti mātito ca pitito ca saṃsuddhagahaṇiko yāva sattamā pitāmahayugā akkhitto anupakkuṭṭho jātivādena, ",
  "snp3.9:2.3": "ettāvatā kho brāhmaṇo hotī\" ti. ",
  "snp3.9:3.1": "Vāseṭṭho māṇavo evam āha: ",
  "snp3.9:3.2": "\"yato kho bho sīlavā ca hoti vatasampanno ca, ",
  "snp3.9:3.3": "ettāvatā kho brāhmaṇo hotī\" ti. ",
  "snp3.9:3.4": "N' eva kho asakkhi Bhāradvājo māṇavo Vāseṭṭhaṃ māṇavaṃ saññapetuṃ, na pana asakkhi Vāseṭṭho māṇavo Bhāradvājaṃ māṇavaṃ saññapetuṃ. ",
  "snp3.9:4.1": "Atha kho Vāseṭṭho māṇavo Bhāradvājaṃ māṇavaṃ āmantesi: ",
  "snp3.9:4.2": "\"ayaṃ kho Bhāradvāja samaṇo Gotamo Sakyaputto Sakyakulā pabbajito Icchānaṃkale viharati Icchānaṃkalavanasaṇḍe, ",
  "snp3.9:4.3": "taṃ kho pana bhavantaṃ Gotamaṃ evaṃ kalyāṇo kittisaddo abbhuggato ",
  "snp3.9:4.4": "--pe-- Buddho Bhagavā ti, ",
  "snp3.9:4.5": "āyāma bho Bhāradvāja, yena samaṇo Gotamo ten' upasaṃkamissāma, upasaṃkamitvā samaṇaṃ Gotamaṃ etam atthaṃ pucchissāma, ",
  "snp3.9:4.6": "yathā no samaṇo Gotamo vyākarissati, tathā naṃ dhāressāmā\" ti. ",
  "snp3.9:4.7": "\"Evaṃ bho\" ti kho Bhāradvājo māṇavo Vāseṭṭhassa māṇavassa paccassosi. ",
  "snp3.9:5.1": "Atha kho Vāseṭṭha-Bhāradvājā māṇavā yena Bhagavā ten' upasaṃkamiṃsu, upasaṃkamitvā Bhagavatā saddhiṃ sammodiṃsu, ",
  "snp3.9:5.2": "sammodanīyaṃ kathaṃ sārāṇīyaṃ vītisāretvā ekamantaṃ nisīdiṃsu. ",
  "snp3.9:5.3": "Ekamantaṃ nisinno kho Vāseṭṭho māṇavo Bhagavantaṃ gāthāhi ajjhabhāsi: 594. ",
  "snp3.9:6.1": "\"Anuññātapatiññātā ",
  "snp3.9:6.2": "tevijjā mayam asm' ubho, ",
  "snp3.9:6.3": "ahaṃ Pokkharasātissa ",
  "snp3.9:6.4": "Tārukkhassāyaṃ māṇavo. 595. ",
  "snp3.9:7.1": "Tevijjānaṃ yad akkhātaṃ, ",
  "snp3.9:7.2": "tatra kevalino smase, ",
  "snp3.9:7.3": "padak' asmā veyyākaraṇā ",
  "snp3.9:7.4": "jape ācariyasādisā. 596. ",
  "snp3.9:8.1": "Tesan no jātivādasmiṃ ",
  "snp3.9:8.2": "vivādo atthi Gotama: ",
  "snp3.9:8.3": "\"jātiyā brāhmaṇo hoti\" ",
  "snp3.9:8.4": "Bhāradvājo iti bhāsati, ",
  "snp3.9:8.5": "ahañ ca \"kammanā\" brūmi, ",
  "snp3.9:8.6": "evaṃ jānāhi cakkhuma. 597. ",
  "snp3.9:9.1": "Te na sakkoma saññattuṃ ",
  "snp3.9:9.2": "aññamaññaṃ mayaṃ ubho, ",
  "snp3.9:9.3": "bhavantaṃ puṭṭhum āgamhā ",
  "snp3.9:9.4": "sambuddhaṃ iti vissutaṃ. 598. ",
  "snp3.9:10.1": "Candaṃ yathā khayātītaṃ ",
  "snp3.9:10.2": "pecca pañjalikā janā ",
  "snp3.9:10.3": "vandamānā namassanti, ",
  "snp3.9:10.4": "evaṃ lokasmiṃ Gotamaṃ. 599. ",
  "snp3.9:11.1": "Cakkhuṃ loke samuppannaṃ ",
  "snp3.9:11.2": "mayaṃ pucchāma Gotamaṃ: ",
  "snp3.9:11.3": "jātiyā brāhmaṇo hoti ",
  "snp3.9:11.4": "udāhu bhavati kammanā, ",
  "snp3.9:11.5": "ajānataṃ no pabrūhi, ",
  "snp3.9:11.6": "yathā jānemu brāhmaṇaṃ\". 600. ",
  "snp3.9:12.1": "\"Tesaṃ vo 'haṃ vyakkhissaṃ ",
  "snp3.9:12.2": "Vāseṭṭhā ti Bhagavā ",
  "snp3.9:12.3": "anupubbaṃ yathātathaṃ ",
  "snp3.9:12.4": "jātivibhaṅgaṃ pāṇānaṃ, ",
  "snp3.9:12.5": "aññamaññā ti jātiyo. 601. ",
  "snp3.9:13.1": "Tiṇarukkhe pi jānātha, ",
  "snp3.9:13.2": "na cāpi paṭijānare, ",
  "snp3.9:13.3": "liṅgaṃ jātimayaṃ tesaṃ, ",
  "snp3.9:13.4": "aññamaññā hi jātiyo. 602. ",
  "snp3.9:14.1": "Tato kīṭe paṭaṅge ca ",
  "snp3.9:14.2": "yāva kunthakipillike, ",
  "snp3.9:14.3": "liṅgaṃ jātimayaṃ tesaṃ, ",
  "snp3.9:14.4": "aññamaññā hi jātiyo. 603. ",
  "snp3.9:15.1": "Catuppade pi jānātha ",
  "snp3.9:15.2": "khuddake ca mahallake, ",
  "snp3.9:15.3": "liṅgaṃ ",
  "snp3.9:15.4": "--pe--. 604. ",
  "snp3.9:16.1": "Pādūdare pi jānātha ",
  "snp3.9:16.2": "urage dīghapiṭṭhike, ",
  "snp3.9:16.3": "liṅgaṃ . . . 605. ",
  "snp3.9:16.4": "",
  "snp3.9:17.1": "Tato macche pi jānātha ",
  "snp3.9:17.2": "urage dīghapiṭṭhike, ",
  "snp3.9:17.3": "liṅgaṃ . . . 606. ",
  "snp3.9:17.4": "",
  "snp3.9:18.1": "Tato pakkhī pi jānātha ",
  "snp3.9:18.2": "pattayāne vihaṅgame, ",
  "snp3.9:18.3": "liṅgaṃ . . . 607. ",
  "snp3.9:18.4": "",
  "snp3.9:19.1": "Yathā etāsu jātisu ",
  "snp3.9:19.2": "liṅgaṃ jātimayaṃ puthu, ",
  "snp3.9:19.3": "evaṃ n' atthi manussesu ",
  "snp3.9:19.4": "liṅgaṃ jātimayaṃ puthu: 608. ",
  "snp3.9:20.1": "na kesehi na sīsena ",
  "snp3.9:20.2": "na kaṇṇehi na akkhihi ",
  "snp3.9:20.3": "na mukhena na nāsāya ",
  "snp3.9:20.4": "na oṭṭhehi bhamūhi vā 609. ",
  "snp3.9:21.1": "na gīvāya na aṃsehi ",
  "snp3.9:21.2": "na udarena na piṭṭhiyā ",
  "snp3.9:21.3": "na soṇiyā na urasā ",
  "snp3.9:21.4": "na sambādhe na methune 610. ",
  "snp3.9:22.1": "na hatthehi na pādehi ",
  "snp3.9:22.2": "na aṅgulīhi nakhehi vā ",
  "snp3.9:22.3": "na jaṃghāhi na ūrūhi ",
  "snp3.9:22.4": "na vaṇṇena sarena vā ",
  "snp3.9:22.5": "liṅgaṃ jātimayaṃ n' eva, ",
  "snp3.9:22.6": "yathā aññāsu jātisu. 611. ",
  "snp3.9:23.1": "Paccattaṃ sasarīresu ",
  "snp3.9:23.2": "manussesv-etaṃ na vijjati ",
  "snp3.9:23.3": "vokārañ ca manussesu ",
  "snp3.9:23.4": "samaññāya pavuccati. 612. ",
  "snp3.9:24.1": "Yo hi koci manussesu ",
  "snp3.9:24.2": "gorakkhaṃ upajīvati, ",
  "snp3.9:24.3": "evaṃ Vāseṭṭha jānāhi, ",
  "snp3.9:24.4": "kassako so, na brāhmaṇo. 613. ",
  "snp3.9:25.1": "Yo hi koci manussesu ",
  "snp3.9:25.2": "puthu sippena jīvati, ",
  "snp3.9:25.3": "evaṃ Vāseṭṭha jānāhi, ",
  "snp3.9:25.4": "sippiko so, na brāhmaṇo. 614. ",
  "snp3.9:26.1": "Yo hi koci manussesu ",
  "snp3.9:26.2": "vohāraṃ upajīvati, ",
  "snp3.9:26.3": "evaṃ Vāseṭṭha jānāhi, ",
  "snp3.9:26.4": "vāṇijo so, na brāhmaṇo. 615. ",
  "snp3.9:27.1": "Yo hi koci manussesu ",
  "snp3.9:27.2": "parapessena jīvati, ",
  "snp3.9:27.3": "evaṃ Vāseṭṭha jānāhi, ",
  "snp3.9:27.4": "pessiko so, na brāhmaṇo. 616. ",
  "snp3.9:28.1": "Yo hi koci manussesu ",
  "snp3.9:28.2": "adinnam upajīvati, ",
  "snp3.9:28.3": "evaṃ Vāseṭṭha jānāhi, ",
  "snp3.9:28.4": "coro eso, na brāhmaṇo. 617. ",
  "snp3.9:29.1": "Yo hi koci manussesu ",
  "snp3.9:29.2": "issatthaṃ upajīvati, ",
  "snp3.9:29.3": "evaṃ Vāseṭṭha jānāhi, ",
  "snp3.9:29.4": "yodhājīvo, na brāhmaṇo. 618. ",
  "snp3.9:30.1": "Yo hi koci manussesu ",
  "snp3.9:30.2": "porohiccena jīvati, ",
  "snp3.9:30.3": "evaṃ Vāseṭṭha jānāhi, ",
  "snp3.9:30.4": "yājako so, na brāhmaṇo. 619. ",
  "snp3.9:31.1": "Yo hi koci manussesu ",
  "snp3.9:31.2": "gāmaṃ raṭṭhañ ca bhuñjati, ",
  "snp3.9:31.3": "evaṃ Vāseṭṭha jānāhi, ",
  "snp3.9:31.4": "rājā eso, na brāhmaṇo. 620. ",
  "snp3.9:32.1": "Na cāhaṃ brāhmaṇaṃ brūmi ",
  "snp3.9:32.2": "yonijaṃ mattisambhavaṃ, ",
  "snp3.9:32.3": "bhovādi nāma so hoti, ",
  "snp3.9:32.4": "sa ve hoti sakiñcano, -- ",
  "snp3.9:32.5": "akiñcanaṃ anādānaṃ ",
  "snp3.9:32.6": "tam ahaṃ brūmi brāhmaṇaṃ. 621. ",
  "snp3.9:33.1": "Sabbasaṃyojanaṃ chetvā ",
  "snp3.9:33.2": "yo ve na paritassati, ",
  "snp3.9:33.3": "saṅgātigaṃ visaṃyuttaṃ ",
  "snp3.9:33.4": "tam ahaṃ brūmi brāhmaṇaṃ. 622. ",
  "snp3.9:34.1": "Chetvā nandhiṃ varattañ ca ",
  "snp3.9:34.2": "sandānaṃ sahanukkamaṃ ",
  "snp3.9:34.3": "ukkhittapalighaṃ buddhaṃ ",
  "snp3.9:34.4": "--pe--. 623. ",
  "snp3.9:35.1": "Akkosaṃ vadhabandhañ ca ",
  "snp3.9:35.2": "aduṭṭho yo titikkhati, ",
  "snp3.9:35.3": "khantībalaṃ balānīkaṃ ",
  "snp3.9:35.4": "tam ahaṃ brūmi brāhmaṇaṃ. 624. ",
  "snp3.9:36.1": "Akkodhanaṃ vatavantaṃ ",
  "snp3.9:36.2": "sīlavantaṃ anussadaṃ ",
  "snp3.9:36.3": "dantaṃ antimasārīraṃ ",
  "snp3.9:36.4": "--pe--. 625. ",
  "snp3.9:37.1": "Vāri pokkharapatte va, ",
  "snp3.9:37.2": "āragge-r-iva sāsapo ",
  "snp3.9:37.3": "yo na lippati kāmesu, . . . 626. ",
  "snp3.9:37.4": "",
  "snp3.9:38.1": "Yo dukkhassa pajānāti ",
  "snp3.9:38.2": "idh' eva khayam, attano, ",
  "snp3.9:38.3": "pannabhāraṃ visaṃyuttaṃ . . . 627. ",
  "snp3.9:38.4": "",
  "snp3.9:39.1": "Gambhīrapaññaṃ medhāviṃ ",
  "snp3.9:39.2": "maggāmaggassa kovidaṃ ",
  "snp3.9:39.3": "uttamatthaṃ anuppattaṃ . . . 628. ",
  "snp3.9:39.4": "",
  "snp3.9:40.1": "Asaṃsaṭṭhaṃ gahaṭṭhehi ",
  "snp3.9:40.2": "anāgārehi cūbhayaṃ ",
  "snp3.9:40.3": "anokasāriṃ appicchaṃ . . . 629. ",
  "snp3.9:40.4": "",
  "snp3.9:41.1": "Nidhāya daṇḍaṃ bhūtesu ",
  "snp3.9:41.2": "tasesu thāvaresu ca ",
  "snp3.9:41.3": "yo na hanti na ghāteti, . . . 630. ",
  "snp3.9:41.4": "",
  "snp3.9:42.1": "Aviruddhaṃ viruddhesu ",
  "snp3.9:42.2": "attadaṇḍesu nibbutaṃ ",
  "snp3.9:42.3": "sādānesu anādānaṃ . . . 631. ",
  "snp3.9:42.4": "",
  "snp3.9:43.1": "Yassa rāgo ca doso ca ",
  "snp3.9:43.2": "māno makkho ca pātito ",
  "snp3.9:43.3": "sāsapo-r-iva āraggā, . . . 632. ",
  "snp3.9:43.4": "",
  "snp3.9:44.1": "Akakkasaṃ viññapaniṃ ",
  "snp3.9:44.2": "giraṃ saccaṃ udīraye, ",
  "snp3.9:44.3": "yāya nabhisaje kañci, . . . 633. ",
  "snp3.9:44.4": "Yo ca ",
  "snp3.9:45.1": "dīghaṃ va rassaṃ vā ",
  "snp3.9:45.2": "aṇuṃthūlaṃ subhāsubhaṃ ",
  "snp3.9:45.3": "loke adinnaṃ nadiyati, . . . 634. ",
  "snp3.9:45.4": "",
  "snp3.9:46.1": "Āsā yassa na vijjanti ",
  "snp3.9:46.2": "asmiṃ loke paramhi ca, ",
  "snp3.9:46.3": "nirāsayaṃ visaṃyuttaṃ . . . 635. ",
  "snp3.9:46.4": "",
  "snp3.9:47.1": "Yassālaya na vijjanti, ",
  "snp3.9:47.2": "aññāya kathaṃkathī, ",
  "snp3.9:47.3": "amatogadhaṃ anuppattaṃ . . . 636. ",
  "snp3.9:47.4": "",
  "snp3.9:48.1": "Yo 'dha puññañ ca pāpañ ca ",
  "snp3.9:48.2": "ubho saṅgaṃ upaccagā, ",
  "snp3.9:48.3": "asokaṃ virajaṃ suddhaṃ . . . 637. ",
  "snp3.9:48.4": "",
  "snp3.9:49.1": "Candaṃ va vimalaṃ suddhaṃ ",
  "snp3.9:49.2": "vippasannaṃ anāvilaṃ ",
  "snp3.9:49.3": "nandībhavaparikkhīṇaṃ . . . 638. ",
  "snp3.9:49.4": "Yo imaṃ ",
  "snp3.9:50.1": "palipathaṃ duggaṃ ",
  "snp3.9:50.2": "saṃsāraṃ moham accagā ",
  "snp3.9:50.3": "tiṇṇo pāragato jhāyī ",
  "snp3.9:50.4": "anejo akathaṃkathī ",
  "snp3.9:50.5": "anupādāya nibbuto, . . . 639. ",
  "snp3.9:50.6": "",
  "snp3.9:51.1": "Yo 'dha kāme pahatvāna ",
  "snp3.9:51.2": "anāgāro paribbaje, ",
  "snp3.9:51.3": "kāmābhavaparikkhīṇaṃ . . . 640. ",
  "snp3.9:51.4": "",
  "snp3.9:52.1": "Yo 'dha taṇhaṃ pahatvāna ",
  "snp3.9:52.2": "anāgāro paribbaje, ",
  "snp3.9:52.3": "taṇhābhavaparikkhīṇaṃ . . . 641. ",
  "snp3.9:52.4": "",
  "snp3.9:53.1": "Hitvā mānusakaṃ yogaṃ ",
  "snp3.9:53.2": "dibbaṃ yogaṃ upaccagā, ",
  "snp3.9:53.3": "sabbayogavisaṃyuttaṃ . . . 642. ",
  "snp3.9:53.4": "",
  "snp3.9:54.1": "Hitvā ratiñ ca aratiñ ca ",
  "snp3.9:54.2": "sītibhūtaṃ nirūpadhiṃ ",
  "snp3.9:54.3": "sabbalokābhibbuṃ vīraṃ . . . 643. ",
  "snp3.9:54.4": "",
  "snp3.9:55.1": "Cutiṃ yo vedi sattānaṃ ",
  "snp3.9:55.2": "upapattiñ ca sabbaso, ",
  "snp3.9:55.3": "asattaṃ sugataṃ buddhaṃ . . . 644. ",
  "snp3.9:55.4": "",
  "snp3.9:56.1": "Yassa gatiṃ na jānanti ",
  "snp3.9:56.2": "devā gandhabbamānusā, ",
  "snp3.9:56.3": "khīṇāsavaṃ arahantaṃ . . . 645. ",
  "snp3.9:56.4": "",
  "snp3.9:57.1": "Yassa pure ca pacchā ca ",
  "snp3.9:57.2": "majjhe ca n' atthi kiñcanaṃ, ",
  "snp3.9:57.3": "akiñcanaṃ anādānaṃ . . . 646. ",
  "snp3.9:57.4": "",
  "snp3.9:58.1": "Usabhaṃ pavaraṃ vīraṃ ",
  "snp3.9:58.2": "mahesiṃ vijitāvinaṃ ",
  "snp3.9:58.3": "anejaṃ nahātakaṃ buddhaṃ . . . 647. ",
  "snp3.9:58.4": "",
  "snp3.9:59.1": "Pubbenivāsaṃ yo vedi ",
  "snp3.9:59.2": "saggāpāyañ ca passati, ",
  "snp3.9:59.3": "atho jātikkhayaṃ patto, ",
  "snp3.9:59.4": "tam ahaṃ brūmi brāh- maṇaṃ. 648. ",
  "snp3.9:60.1": "Samaññā h' esā lokasmiṃ ",
  "snp3.9:60.2": "nāmagottaṃ pakappitaṃ, ",
  "snp3.9:60.3": "sammuccā samudāgataṃ ",
  "snp3.9:60.4": "tattha tattha pakappi- taṃ, 649. ",
  "snp3.9:61.1": "dīgharattam anusayitaṃ ",
  "snp3.9:61.2": "diṭṭhigatam ajānataṃ, -- ",
  "snp3.9:61.3": "ajānantā no pabruvanti: ",
  "snp3.9:61.4": "\"jātiyā hoti brāhmaṇo\". 650. ",
  "snp3.9:62.1": "Na jaccā brāhmaṇo hoti, ",
  "snp3.9:62.2": "na jaccā hoti abrāhmaṇo, ",
  "snp3.9:62.3": "kammanā brāhmaṇo hoti, ",
  "snp3.9:62.4": "kammanā hoti abrāhmaṇo. 651. ",
  "snp3.9:63.1": "Kassako kammanā hoti, ",
  "snp3.9:63.2": "sippiko hoti kammanā, ",
  "snp3.9:63.3": "vāṇijo kammanā hoti, ",
  "snp3.9:63.4": "pessiko hoti kammanā, 652. ",
  "snp3.9:64.1": "coro pi kammanā hoti, ",
  "snp3.9:64.2": "yodhājīvo pi kammanā, ",
  "snp3.9:64.3": "yājako kammanā hoti , ",
  "snp3.9:64.4": "rājā pi hoti kammanā. 653. ",
  "snp3.9:65.1": "Evam etaṃ yathābhūtaṃ ",
  "snp3.9:65.2": "kammaṃ passanti paṇḍitā ",
  "snp3.9:65.3": "paṭiccasamuppādadasā ",
  "snp3.9:65.4": "kammavipākakovidā. 654. ",
  "snp3.9:66.1": "Kammanā vattatī loko, ",
  "snp3.9:66.2": "kammanā vattatī pajā, ",
  "snp3.9:66.3": "kammanibandhanā sattā ",
  "snp3.9:66.4": "rathassāṇiva yāyato. 655. ",
  "snp3.9:67.1": "Tapena brahmacariyena ",
  "snp3.9:67.2": "saṃyamena damena ca -- ",
  "snp3.9:67.3": "etena brāhmaṇo hoti, ",
  "snp3.9:67.4": "etaṃ brāhmaṇam utta- maṃ. 656. ",
  "snp3.9:68.1": "Tīhi vijjāhi sampanno ",
  "snp3.9:68.2": "santo khīṇapunabbhavo, ",
  "snp3.9:68.3": "evaṃ Vāseṭṭha jānāhi, ",
  "snp3.9:68.4": "Brahmā Sakko vijāna- tan\" ti. ",
  "snp3.9:69.1": "Evaṃ vutte Vāseṭṭha-hāradvājā māṇavā Bhagavantaṃ etad avocuṃ: ",
  "snp3.9:69.2": "\"abhikkantaṃ bho Gotama --pe-- *ete mayaṃ bhavantaṃ Gotamaṃ saraṇaṃ gacchāma dhammañ ca bhikkhusaṃghañ ca, ",
  "snp3.9:69.3": "*upāsake no bhavaṃ Gotamo dhāretu ajjatagge pāṇupete saraṇāgate\" ti ",
  "snp3.9:69.4": "VĀSEṬṬHASUTTAṂ NIṬṬHITAṂ. "
}
